  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HAVOYOCO Employment Creation Project in Somaliland</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Youth skills training and job placement., Beneficiaries: 200 youth, of whom 110 are women., Summary: This project will provide marketable skills training for 200 youth in Hargeisa and Burao over two years. Beneficiaries will be trained in: auto-mechanics, electronics, tailoring and tie &amp; dye, food processing, and hospitality. Trainees will also engage in business and job placements to acquire experience and get employed to improve their livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
